 cable, 1x SMA male calibration kit - OPEN, 1x SMA male calibration kit - SHORT, 1x SMA male calibration kit - LOAD, 2x SMA female to female connector, 2x SMA male to male connector. The LibreVNA is highly functional and capable of meeting the demands of RF engineers, researchers, or hobbyists for a wide range of RF measurements and microwave network parameter measurements</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p><strong>Because LibreVNA is relatively complex to operate, you can get professional remote meeting support and explanation after purchasing the product!</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>The latest hardware has been upgraded to support V1.6.2 Firmware and GUI.</strong></p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>We and <strong>Jankae</strong> jointly developed <strong>LibreVNA</strong>.Based on the latest <strong>LibreVNA</strong> hardware design, we have spent more time and effort optimizing the impedance control and stacking control between <strong>6</strong>-layer boards to achieve better high-frequency isolation. First-class product quality, but also need first-class professional service, after all, the equipment is not used is the biggest waste need to understand the use of <strong>LibreVNA</strong>, please move to station BiLiBiLi, you will learn:</p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1. After unboxing, the adjustment and adaptation process of LibreVNA''s host computer software </span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">and firmware. (very important)</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2. How to use LibreVNA GUI 1.5.0.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">3. Calibration method of LibreVNA: calibration method without wire and with wire.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">4. How LibreVNA measures antennas and attenuators and adjusts antenna matching in com-</span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">bination with Keysight ADS.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"unicode-bidi: embed;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">5. LibreVNA program automation test process and method.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\">\u00a0</div>\n\n<p><strong>All professional video training materials are available in the TinyRFEquip account of Bilibili, hoping to be able to connect three times with one click. Related firmware, GUI, operation instructions, circuit diagrams, software control programs, all in Baidu cloud disk and mobile cloud disk.</strong></p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>Google Cloud Drive</p>\n\n<p>https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YZBoOaVeXCeArZZNnu49Q4pUKuTufpCc?usp=sharing</p>\n\n<p>About warranty: Precision equipment is not man-made damage, signed and collected, and the physical warranty is one year.</p>\n\n<p>Customer site test diagram:<cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14195) \" title=\"Picture / Image - Image (14195)\" id=\"14195\"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14196) \" title=\"Picture / Image - Image (14196)\" id=\"14196\"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14197) \" title=\"Picture / Image - Image (14197)\" id=\"14197\"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14198) \" title=\"Picture / Image - Image (14198)\" id=\"14198\"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14199) \" title=\"Picture / Image - Image (14199)\" id=\"14199\"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt=\"Picture / Image - Image (14200) \" title=\"