INSERT INTO djangocms_history_placeholderaction VALUES(1258,'change_plugin','{"plugins": [{"pk": 11057, "creation_date": "2024-12-20T12:37:21.671Z", "position": 0, "plugin_type": "TextPlugin", "parent_id": 11056, "data": {"body": "<p>There are a wide variety of RF connectors, making them extremely difficult to carry. RF enthusiasts and engineers often lose them due to poor storage. As a senior RF engineer, the shop owner shares the same feeling, so he designed this RF ToolKit. The ToolKit is exquisite, compact, and very easy to carry. On the basis of ensuring the 0-6G frequency coverage of all adapters, the carefully selected connector materials ensure the durability of the connectors. At the same time, advanced industrial plastics are used to make a sealed and waterproof storage box, which is very durable. It can be used as a gift for other RF engineers, please feel free to use it.</p>\n\n<p>RF adapter ToolKit product list (no network calibration part version)<br>\nThe size of KX-01 ToolKit toolbox is 223 \u00d7 158 \u00d7 42mm<br>\nN female head straight through x 1<br>\nN-head straight through x 1<br>\nN male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA female head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N male head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N male head x 1<br>\nBNC male head to SMA female head x 1<br>\nBNC female head to SMA male head x 1<br>\nSMA isolated by 1</p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>RF Adapter ToolKit Product List (Upgraded Version)<br>\nThe size of KX-01 ToolKit toolbox is 22315842 mm</p>\n\n<p>N female head straight through 1<br>\nN-head straight through 1<br>\nN male head to female head 1<br>\nSMA male head straight through 1<br>\nSMA female head straight through 1<br>\nSMA male head to female head 1<br>\nSMA male head to N female head 1<br>\nSMA male head to N male head 1<br>\nSMA female head to N female head 1<br>\nSMA female head to N male head 1<br>\nBNC male head to SMA female head 1<br>\nBNC female head to SMA male head 1<br>\nSMA Straight 1<br>\nSMA Head Vector Network Analyzer Calibration Parts: (Supports up to 6G)\u00a0 \u00a0open1, short1, load1<br>\nCalibration parts for N-head vector network analyzer: (Upgraded version can support up to 8.5G, suitable for R&amp;S and related products from KeySight)\u00a0 open1\u3001short1\u3001load1</p>"}}]}','{"plugins": [{"pk": 11057, "creation_date": "2024-12-20T12:37:21.671Z", "position": 0, "plugin_type": "TextPlugin", "parent_id": 11056, "data": {"body": "<p>There are a wide variety of RF connectors, making them extremely difficult to carry. RF enthusiasts and engineers often lose them due to poor storage. As a senior RF engineer, the shop owner shares the same feeling, so he designed this RF ToolKit. The ToolKit is exquisite, compact, and very easy to carry. On the basis of ensuring the 0-6G frequency coverage of all adapters, the carefully selected connector materials ensure the durability of the connectors. At the same time, advanced industrial plastics are used to make a sealed and waterproof storage box, which is very durable. It can be used as a gift for other RF engineers, please feel free to use it.</p>\n\n<p>RF adapter ToolKit product list (standard version)<br>\nThe size of KX-01ToolKit toolbox is 223 \u00d7 158 \u00d7 42mm<br>\nN female head straight through x 1<br>\nN-head straight through x 1<br>\nN male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA female head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N male head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N male head x 1<br>\nBNC male head to SMA female head x 1<br>\nBNC female head to SMA male head x 1<br>\nCalibration parts for N-terminal vector network analyzer (open \u00d7 1, short \u00d7 1, load \u00d7 1)<br>\nSMA Head Vector Network Analyzer Calibration Parts (open \u00d7 1, short \u00d7 1, load \u00d7 1)<br>\nSMA isolated by 1</p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>RF adapter ToolKit product list (no network calibration part version)<br>\nThe size of KX-01 ToolKit toolbox is 223 \u00d7 158 \u00d7 42mm<br>\nN female head straight through x 1<br>\nN-head straight through x 1<br>\nN male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA female head straight through x 1<br>\nSMA male head to female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA male head to N male head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N female head x 1<br>\nSMA female head to N male head x 1<br>\nBNC male head to SMA female head x 1<br>\nBNC female head to SMA male head x 1<br>\nSMA isolated by 1</p>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>RF Adapter ToolKit Product List (Upgraded Version)<br>\nThe size of KX-01 ToolKit toolbox is 22315842 mm</p>\n\n<p>N female head straight through 1<br>\nN-head straight through 1<br>\nN male head to female head 1<br>\nSMA male head straight through 1<br>\nSMA female head straight through 1<br>\nSMA male head to female head 1<br>\nSMA male head to N female head 1<br>\nSMA male head to N male head 1<br>\nSMA female head to N female head 1<br>\nSMA female head to N male head 1<br>\nBNC male head to SMA female head 1<br>\nBNC female head to SMA male head 1<br>\nSMA Straight 1<br>\nSMA Head Vector Network Analyzer Calibration Parts: (Supports up to 6G)\u00a0 \u00a0open1, short1, load1<br>\nCalibration parts for N-head vector network analyzer: (Upgraded version can support up to 8.5G, suitable for R&amp;S and related products from KeySight)\u00a0 open1\u3001short1\u3001load1</p>"}}]}','en',1,1225,84);
INSERT INTO djangocms_history_placeholderaction VALUES(1259,'change_plugin','{"plugins": [{"pk": 1040, "creation_date": "2024-12-20T11:50:21.552Z", "position": 0, "plugin_type": "TextPlugin", "parent_id": 1039, "data": {"body": "<p>Welcome to the website of Tiny RF Equipment, which covers and introduces many miniature and efficient RF microwave testing equipment, components, and related RF modules. These products are mainly used to meet the basic needs of wireless product testing, amateur radio testing enthusiasts, and students'' learning needs. This is a free and open website, hoping to communicate with everyone more professionally and quickly about RF professional issues. The products here strive to achieve the maximum economic input-output ratio for customers.</p>\n\n<p>At the same time, our studio engineers are proficient in RF instruments related to Shide, Rod, and Anli, providing online and on-site training and consultation. For more information, please contact us directly on Taobao or email.The most important thing in purchasing equipment is the performance and technical support of the equipment itself. as an old engineer of RF, I hope to provide customers with professional consulting services.</p>\n\n<p>The RF field belongs to the communication industry, which is a small part of the so-called information industry. But the wireless radio frequency field is the most important point that distinguishes the communication industry from other electronic industries. From the early mobile phones to the current 5G communication terminals, from the battlefield walkie talkies during World War II to the contemporary global satellite phones, from civilian satellite pots to various high-tech radars for military use, it can be said that everything is changing rapidly.</p>\n\n<p>I entered the communication RF industry after graduation, and over the years, I have gone from being naive to thoughtful, which has been a very difficult journey. The purpose of restoring our store is to collaborate with like-minded friends to research technical issues and promote scientific research together. For friends outside the industry who need knowledge and services in the field of radio frequency, they can come to our store for consultation and negotiation, hoping to help you.</p>\n\n<p>This laboratory is located in A001 studio on the 4th floor of Tianjin Times Digital.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><strong>Currently, there are products included\uff1aTinySA, TinySA Ultra, NanoVNA\uff0cNanoVNA-H2, NanoVNA-H4, \u00a0NanoVNA SAA2, LiteVNA, LibreVNA \uff0cTinyRFSG</strong></span></p>"}}]}','{"plugins": [{"pk": 1040, "creation_date": "2024-12-20T11:50:21.552Z", "position": 0, "plugin_type": "TextPlugin", "parent_id": 1039, "data": {"body": "<p>Welcome to the website of Tiny RF Equipment, which covers and introduces many miniature and efficient RF microwave testing equipment, components, and related RF modules. These products are mainly used to meet the basic needs of wireless product testing, amateur radio testing enthusiasts, and students'' learning needs. This is a free and open website, hoping to communicate with everyone more professionally and quickly about RF professional issues. The products here strive to achieve the maximum economic input-output ratio for customers.</p>\n\n<p>At the same time, our studio engineers are proficient in RF instruments related to Shide, Rod, and Anli, providing online and on-site training and consultation. For more information, please contact us directly on Taobao or email.The most important thing in purchasing equipment is the performance and technical support of the equipment itself. as an old engineer of RF, I hope to provide customers with professional consulting services.</p>\n\n<p><strong>What I want to say</strong></p>\n\n<p>The RF field belongs to the communication industry, which is a small part of the so-called information industry. But the wireless radio frequency field is the most important point that distinguishes the communication industry from other electronic industries. From the early mobile phones to the current 5G communication terminals, from the battlefield walkie talkies during World War II to the contemporary global satellite phones, from civilian satellite pots to various high-tech radars for military use, it can be said that everything is changing rapidly.</p>\n\n<p>I entered the communication RF industry after graduation, and over the years, I have gone from being naive to thoughtful, which has been a very difficult journey. The purpose of restoring our store is to collaborate with like-minded friends to research technical issues and promote scientific research together. For friends outside the industry who need knowledge and services in the field of radio frequency, they can come to our store for consultation and negotiation, hoping to help you.</p>\n\n<p>This laboratory is located in A001 studio on the 4th floor of Tianjin Times Digital.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><strong>Currently, there are products included\uff1aTinySA, TinySA Ultra, NanoVNA\uff0cNanoVNA-H2, NanoVNA-H4, \u00a0NanoVNA SAA2, LiteVNA, LibreVNA \uff0cTinyRFSG</strong></span></p>"}}]}','en',1,1226,12);
