INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #999999;">Technological innovation makes future development incredible</span></p>',1038);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p><strong>What I want to say</strong></p>\n\n<p>The RF field belongs to the communication industry, which is a small part of the so-called information industry. But the wireless radio frequency field is the most important point that distinguishes the communication industry from other electronic industries. From the early mobile phones to the current 5G communication terminals, from the battlefield walkie talkies during World War II to the contemporary global satellite phones, from civilian satellite pots to various high-tech radars for military use, it can be said that everything is changing rapidly.</p>\n\n<p>I entered the communication RF industry after graduation, and over the years, I have gone from being naive to thoughtful, which has been a very difficult journey. The purpose of restoring our store is to collaborate with like-minded friends to research technical issues and promote scientific research together. For friends outside the industry who need knowledge and services in the field of radio frequency, they can come to our store for consultation and negotiation, hoping to help you.</p>\n\n<p>This laboratory is located in A001 studio on the 4th floor of Tianjin Times Digital.</p>\n\n<p style="text-align: center;"><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (15950) " title="Picture / Image - Image (15950)" id="15950"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><strong>Currently, there are products included：LibreVNA Plus, LibreVNA Normal, TinySA, TinySA Ultra ZS406 and ZS407, NanoVNA-F V2, NanoVNA-F V3, LiteVNA, TinyRFSG Smart, TinyRFSG Plus, TinyRFPM</strong></p>','\n',char(10)),1040);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Technological innovation makes future development incredible</strong></p>',1098);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li>Tinysa ULTRA+ ZS406 owns high performance frequency in 100khz to 900MHz, and when in ultra mode, the analyzer can reach 5.4GHz. With new 4'''' touchscreen display and installed with the latest hardware system V0.4.6. Built-in 32Gb micro TF card for data transfer and storage</li>\n	<li>[Frequency Range] Tinysa ultra measures from 100KHz-5.4GHz: Spectrum Analyzer for 0.1MHz-900MHz, with Ultra mode enabled, level calibrated up to 6GHz, can observe signals up to 12GHz. RBW from 200Hz-850kHz, you can fast and accurate execute measurement tests. Color display showing max 450 points providing gapless covering up to the full frequency range</li>\n	<li><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=849801646126&amp;pisk=gX4tqf4J49XM3Satt5SHm0DDW8C3BMVN9RPWoxDMcJeLGRMinfTsAvGoNdG_Gx0YH-exIm6ZSreLh-L0jP0icZMLCEmgkS8xGSwV_xfNx5PZuq6lETbu_5Pmp0JbWFGIOWl2cdsnfQ9nXxWlEablfBgABT2c67FGRbhSlfijCD1KZbvslmgXO6hjidtX5-1d9jcXCCMjl2tINv9XlhTbO2G-NnGscj1LOvlxhqgbh21Kgbcfvx-sEEEPYctfdgRKPqaK6cH79g8XkOGeExN6YELbJkUIFaDplEaK6ShpA5YRmYZrI0D0dwYtkWGYIv25Pe3I2uPmMRQ95VqQYPug-TpmX2ksVoid1NNKWAn85cQACVEbQrnaXI5zOVwU4Yo1Y9lLSzmxUDpCCWVKC0EYI98jIuFQp04HKU04LowjMJ9O43zuykmBEYhDf6Cp0nosT0l3hX6Trmvj9Yfnsn-qvMlKE6Cp0nosTXHltKx20DIF.&amp;skuId=5757350816604&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0">Purchase link:TinySA ULTRA Spectrum Analyzer 10K-12GHz Bluetooth Ham RF</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Price: 752 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),1340);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-2">[Upgraded TinySA Ultra ZS406] TinySA Ultra owns high performance frequency in 100khz to 900MHz, and when in ultra mode, the analyzer can reach 5.4GHz. With new 4'''' touchscreen display and installed with the latest hardware system V0.4.6. Built-in 32Gb micro TF card for data transfer and storage</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-3">[Frequency Range] Tiny sa ultra measures from 100KHz-5.4GHz: Spectrum Analyzer for 0.1MHz-900MHz, with Ultra mode enabled, level calibrated up to 6GHz, can observe signals up to 12GHz. RBW can be set from 200Hz-850kHz, you can fast and accurate execute measurement tests. Color display showing max 450 points providing gapless covering up to the full frequency range</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-4">[2 in 1 Device] When not used as Spectrum Analyzer it can be used as Signal Generator, MF/HF/VHF sinus output between 100kHZ-900MHz, UHF square wave output between 800mHz-4.4GHz, Mixing signal output is between 4.4GHz-5.4GHz. Built-in calibration signal generator that is used for automatic self test and level calibration</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-5">[PC Operation] Connected to a PC via USB. The USB interface implements CDC protocol and there is a large set of commands that can be invoked over the serial interface. These command can be used to perform MEAS or update internal settings. Tinysa-APP transfers data directly to the computer. The driver for Windows will install automatically after connecting to a Windows10 or Win11 PC. The driver for Linux is built into the kernel</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-6">[200Hz-850kHz RBW] RBW frequency from 200hz to 850khz which can be set to match the measurement requirements, meet SBB two-tone test requirements and fast scanning. The RBW is as low as 200Hz, which can effectively distinguish adjacent signals and meet the requirements of SSB dual-satellite inter-modulation test. Input Step attenuator from 0dB to 31dB (can not be used not in combination with LNA)</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-7">[What You Get] 1x Tinysa ULTRA (4inch touchscreen, 5000mah rechargeable battery); 2x 30cm ALSR100 SMA cables; 1 x USB Type-C data cable; 1x SMA-SMA barrel connector; 1x TLanyard and touch plectrum; 1x Antenna with SMA connector; 1x 32GB MicroSD card(plugged in the host), 1x Stylus Pen</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure> </figure>\n\n<figure>\n<p><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_ultra.jpg"></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14325) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14325)" id="14325"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p>Using TinySA to test satellite RF module for transmission. </p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (13692) " title="Picture / Image - Image (13692)" id="13692"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (13693) " title="Picture / Image - Image (13693)" id="13693"></cms-plugin></p>\n</figure>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14326) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14326)" id="14326"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),1346);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p><strong> TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra</strong></p>',1542);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p><strong>TinySA是一种小型频谱分析仪和信号发生器，具有一些不错的功能：</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>TinySA基本特点:</strong>\n\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 2.8英寸</li>\n		<li>带两个输入端口的频谱分析仪，Low端口用于 10KHz-350MHz 的高质量 MF/HF/VHF 输入，High端口用于 240MHz-960MHz 的 UHF 输入。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器具有两个输出，正弦波输出为100KHz - 350MHz，方波输出为 240MHz-960MHz，信号发生器和频谱分析仪同一时刻只能选择其中的一个功能。</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最多 290个扫描点，提供长达整个低频或高频范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li><strong>TinySA</strong> <strong>Ultra基本特点:</strong>\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 4英寸</li>\n		<li>频谱分析仪模式，初始状态为10KHz-800MHz，在启用独特的Ultra模式的情况下，可以监测高达12GHz的信号。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器模式，正弦波输出在100KHz-800MHz之间，射频测试信号的方波输出高达5.3GHz。</li>\n		<li>200Hz至850KHz的RBW设置提供更高的灵敏度范围。</li>\n		<li>内置 20dB 可选 LNA</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最大 450 个点，提供长达整个频率范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n		<li>MicroSD卡插槽，用于存储测量值，设置和屏幕截图。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>输入步进衰减器从0dB到31dB（不能与LNA结合使用）。</li>\n	<li>内置校准信号发生器，用于自动自检和（低）输入校准。</li>\n	<li>通过USB连接到PC，它成为PC控制的频谱分析仪或信号发生器</li>\n	<li>高达3000mah的可充电电池，可携带至少2小时。</li>\n	<li>最大输入电平 +6dBm。</li>\n	<li>信号发生器功能不能用作跟踪发生器，因为您不能同时使用频谱分析仪和信号发生器功能。</li>\n	<li>由于低成本和非常小的外形尺寸，存在某些相关的微小SA限制和微小SA超限制。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_housing.jpg"></figure>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_ultra.jpg"></figure>\n\n<p><strong>视频教学：</strong></p>\n\n<p>可以在B站也就是哔哩哔哩_bilibili网站搜索TinyRFEquip账号找到介绍TinySA和TinySA Ultra以及其他TinyRFEquip仪器的主要功能介绍视频。例如：</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212">TinySA Ultra对于无线话筒的频率特性检定测量_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</a></p>\n\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212</p>\n\n<p><strong>法律内容</strong></p>\n\n<p>TinySA和TinySA Ultra的名称以及TinySA徽标是我们拥有的注册商标。未经书面许可，不允许其他人使用TinySA这个名字 或 TinySA Ultra 用于任何频谱分析仪产品。</p>','\n',char(10)),1548);
