INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li>The measurement range of  NanoVNA-F V2 is extended to 50k-4.4GHz,the dynamic range is improved, reach to 80db. Can be used to debug the duplexer, more accurate, and simple.Which can measure S-parameter, voltage standing wave ratio SWR, phase map, group delay, Smith chart and so on.</li>\n	<li>Built-in 5000mAh lithium battery, standby time up to 2-3 hours, Using high current 2A charging IC to Shorten charging time, and extended 5V/1A USB output interface. It can be used as a Mobile Power Pack to charge mobile phones when not in use.</li>\n	<li>Support Chinese and English interface;Support interpolation of calibration results.</li>\n	<li>NanoVNA V2 with 4.3-inch IPS LCD display,ultra-wide viewing angle,support screen brightness adjustment,long-term use does not hurt your eyes.Full touching screen design, with 3 side buttons at the same time, flexible and convenient operation.</li>\n	<li>Package List】1 * 4.3inch 3G NanoVNA-F V2 Host;1 * SMA Open Calibration Kit;1 * SMA Short-circuit Calibration Kit;1 * SMA 50Ω Load Calibration Kit;1 * SMA-KK Double-Head Female Hole Adapter;1 * SMA-JJ Double-Head Male Pin Adapter;1 * SMA-JKW Elbow Outer Screw Inner Hole To Inner Screw Inner Needles Adapter;2 * 200mm SMA-JJ RG405 RF Cable;1 * USB Type-C Cable;1 * White Touchscreen Pen</li>\n	<li><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=807998150178&amp;pisk=gZ-i4X2jyF7szOGdJHssrrHMd30pfGsfTIEAMiCq865QXIIODkPFntaa0l7w-tRvOxM1XK5DiBCBXA1xCSADndb2MspTCeOJUlKt5iEcfisqwbn-2O91ciWO7LZ4CMWf3soA_s5FftHa1-ci2d91cRVqeeo8nkmU7RzVgISF8tWA0PW4bvbFntI4bZra8W5CTiWN0loFLt60u5R40pPFBOVVQOSVYWW1TsSV_skHL66c0slPhJ59gCtEOlsonbfm7XXhS_JNtuvBxOy5901_0QtdQNx4h6rVpHXGS_JwqPvhW9-pxaQLHfSeFedNKgmL7gJHuQYyG4UCjK8wGwAsOyfp8ep2vwy47pxcsa-N--qDIdW2gZYIZuBGXebkjFMbTdRRsUS6H8c9KaYhP97UnPS9yLKfzhogN6Q5nCCpa0rhYZSyQyzyZ0rfLxKUlr_Nd9f-PD6KdeKOFRDnKz85796Z2vD3lr_Nd9f-Kv4rdNWCQ0C..&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0&amp;skuId=5490233284178">Purchase link：NanoVNA-F V2 50k-4.4G vector network analyzer Antenna filter impedance matching</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Price: 560 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),1575);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('',1581);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>LiteVNA-64 improves on the popular NanoVNA and SAA2. Now you can get a portable vector network analyzer (VNA) as small as the NanoVNA and capable of meeting the ultra-wide measurement range of 50 kHz to 6.3 GHz.<br>\n<br>\nTo minimize power consumption and size, the LiteVNA-64 uses only one frequency mixer, with multiple internal RF switches for S11 and S21 measurements, and IFFT calculations for TDR and DTF measurements.<br>\n<br>\nDesigned with the community''s input in mind, the LiteVNA-64 now brings faster scanning speeds and more scan points in addition to a wider measurement range. Combined with an easy-to-use interface consistent with the NanoVNA, it can now be easily used as a field test tool.<br>\n<br>\nLiteVNA-64 includes a MicroSD slot, so you can save field test data or screens to a MicroSD card at any time. With a measurement range of up to 6.3GHz, the LiteVNA-64 is capable of meeting common amateur radio and IoT applications, as well as emerging 5GHz testing, enabling the application of the latest 5.8GHz wifi and 5.8GHz image transmission.</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=755371705235&amp;pisk=gmQK2a_x0R23k-_ps6riqnvoJtFMJlfU695jrLvnVOBON99HEBgBfdODGvOCNLYReTBJK3we-aBOFT3lxwYHVz9Od4xhy_uJN_6zTLVUj65ezUw0n-4cT65kBnk5JBTsC1RmRXZMAjMMvLy0nr40AfT8p-Xu9dKs1IdXPBtWdhN9iIDBP39B55dWZviSRTNT6QASdX9WPFi6GdMIAB9ICFOXNDOWdBNO1dRWPL6WA5CsZKE9UD9myirwA0wsy2sf2NdpvK1T04g-cIHDC6tty4pLgH9bod3SPNddwCn1tqEkhiJHmLX_S2LR1QBHItajWFtA0_ARpy3B-GsN8ebgHYxp7ptfVhFQR1LppnQBvzeBJg6FyHSKaS56ROS23HZaQCQho3p2XAwCs1pBDgB3Q49hD169mNDioUWNVTORCvIyTZbAjhMDHQmQ65nr4HOw0CXW1JQDqYO9n5An40-TbCp065nr4HOw6KViE0oyXl5..&amp;skuId=5207120012805&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0">Purchase link：LiteVNA vector network analyzer 50k-6.3G Antenna Cable Impedance matching measure filter</a></p>\n\n<p>Price: 899 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),1641);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>We have updated LiteVNA-64 to version 0.3.1, redesigned the power supply and IF circuit, greatly reduced noise floor and completely solved interference when it is connected to an external power supply. Below 1MHz-3GHz frequencies, effective dynamics of better than 90dB can be obtained with 20AVG. Above 3 GHz, the limited isolation is reduced. The effective dynamic reduction is reduced to 50dB at 6.3GHz. Compared to similar products, LiteVNA-64 has a wider frequency measurement range and an effective dynamic range. Furthermore, it is more light and reliable!</p>\n\n<p>Because the design of LiteVNA evolved from NanoVNA, it not only has a wider measurement range, but also has faster scanning speed and more scanning points. It has an easy-to-use interface consistent with NanoVNA, and all control software compatible with NanoVNA, such as TinyRFeqipApp, Nano_Spp, and NanoVNA saver, can be perfectly matched with LiteVNA. Now, LiteVNA can be easily used as a testing tool for on-site and remote control.</p>\n\n<p>Affected by the current tight chip supply, we still hope that LiteVNA series is an affordable device for hobbyists and startups. The 0.3.1 version of the LiteVNA-64 is currently in short supply.</p>\n\n<p><b>Package Included:</b><br>\n- 1 x LiteVNA-64 Main Unit (with 3.95-inch touch screen and 2000mAh battery)<br>\n- 2 x 30cm/11.8" SMA Male to Male SS405 RF Cables<br>\n- 1 x SMA Female-to-Female Connector<br>\n- 1 x SMA Simple Calibration Kit SHORT<br>\n- 1 x SMA Simple Calibration Kit OPEN<br>\n- 1 x SMA Simple Calibration Kit LOAD<br>\n- 1 x USB Type-C Data Cable<br>\n- 1 x Pick</p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (15288) " title="Picture / Image - Image (15288)" id="15288"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (15289) " title="Picture / Image - Image (15289)" id="15289"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),1647);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li>LibreVNA is a open-source hardware, USB based full 2-port vector network analyzer (VNA) designed by Jankae, provides a 100kHz to 6GHz ultra-wide frequency range. Updated 6-layer PCB design that optimizes S12 port isolation and high-frequency port matching. Supports firmware update and can load a new microcontroller firmware and FPGA configuration into the LibreVNA</li>\n	<li>[Comparable to Lab-grade Nano VNA] The ultra-low noise power supply design and the use of 16bit ADC, together with the precision CNC''s aluminum shielded housing, achieve up to 100dB of effective dynamics. Using 3 ADCs to sample data simultaneously and using FPGAs for signal processing.</li>\n	<li>[Full S-Parameters Measurements] In the LibreVNA operating mode, the VNA can measure the complete S11, S21, S12 and S21 parameters. A source signal is generated and alternately applied to the RF ports. This incoming signal at both RF ports is measured, resulting in the four S-parameters S11 and S21(when signal routes to Port 1), as well as S12 and S22(when signal routes to Port 2)</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>You can buy from <a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?ft=t&amp;id=850498267983&amp;spm=a21dvs.23580594.0.0.1d292c1bCF41l9">Taobao LibreLink</a></p>\n\n	<p>You can learn by video from<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@RFTinyEquip-Terry">Youtube Link</a></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Price: 3290 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),1707);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-1">[Frequency range] Supports a wide range of frequency measurements from 100kHz to 6GHz, upgraded Frequency Accuracy is &lt;2ppm. The S12 can achieve over 90dB of port isolation below 3GHz, allowing measurements above 6GHz use harmonics. During up to 9GHz actual tests, both S11 and S22 have more than 10dB port directivity, and S12, S21 have more than 40dB dynamics</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-4">[Full S-Parameters Measurements] In the LibreVNA operating mode, the VNA can measure the complete S11, S21, S12 and S21 parameters. A source signal is generated and alternately applied to the RF ports. This incoming signal at both RF ports is measured, resulting in the four S-parameters S11 and S21(when signal routes to Port 1), as well as S12 and S22(when signal routes to Port 2)</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-5">[3 In 1 Device] Although the VNA hardware is not designed to be used as spectrum analyzer and signal generator, the general hardware architecture of a spectrum analyzer and signal generator are similar enough to that of a VNA to implement basic spectrum measurements and output a CW signal, which might suffice if no other equipment is available. The main differences to a real spectrum analyzer and signal generator please refer to the product manual</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-6">[PC Software Control] The LibreVNA needs to be used with the host computer software and a separate screen, as it does not have a built-in monitor. LibreVNA provides software for the Windows and Ubuntu platforms. You just need to download and unzip it to run. Supported Operating System: Windows, Linux, MacOS. (Only 64-bit software is available for now)</li>\n	<li id="bundle-v2-btf-component-bullet-point-1-7">[Packing List] 1x LibreVNA host, 1x USB type-C data cable, 1x USB power cable, 2x 30cm SMA male to male SS405 RF cable, 1x SMA male calibration kit - OPEN, 1x SMA male calibration kit - SHORT, 1x SMA male calibration kit - LOAD, 2x SMA female to female connector, 2x SMA male to male connector. The LibreVNA is highly functional and capable of meeting the demands of RF engineers, researchers, or hobbyists for a wide range of RF measurements and microwave network parameter measurements</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><strong>Because LibreVNA is relatively complex to operate, you can get professional remote meeting support and explanation after purchasing the product!</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>The latest hardware has been upgraded to support V1.6.2 Firmware and GUI.</strong></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>We and <strong>Jankae</strong> jointly developed <strong>LibreVNA</strong>.Based on the latest <strong>LibreVNA</strong> hardware design, we have spent more time and effort optimizing the impedance control and stacking control between <strong>6</strong>-layer boards to achieve better high-frequency isolation. First-class product quality, but also need first-class professional service, after all, the equipment is not used is the biggest waste need to understand the use of <strong>LibreVNA</strong>, please move to station BiLiBiLi, you will learn:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<div style=""><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">1. After unboxing, the adjustment and adaptation process of LibreVNA''s host computer software </span></span></span></span><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">and firmware. (very important)</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=""><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">2. How to use LibreVNA GUI 1.5.0.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=""><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">3. Calibration method of LibreVNA: calibration method without wire and with wire.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=""><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">4. How LibreVNA measures antennas and attenuators and adjusts antenna matching in com-</span></span></span></span><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">bination with Keysight ADS.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=""><span style=""><span style="unicode-bidi: embed;"><span style=""><span style="">5. LibreVNA program automation test process and method.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div style=""> </div>\n\n<p><strong>All professional video training materials are available in the TinyRFEquip account of Bilibili, hoping to be able to connect three times with one click. Related firmware, GUI, operation instructions, circuit diagrams, software control programs, all in Baidu cloud disk and mobile cloud disk.</strong></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Google Cloud Drive</p>\n\n<p>https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YZBoOaVeXCeArZZNnu49Q4pUKuTufpCc?usp=sharing</p>\n\n<p>About warranty: Precision equipment is not man-made damage, signed and collected, and the physical warranty is one year.</p>\n\n<p>Customer site test diagram:<cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14195) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14195)" id="14195"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14196) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14196)" id="14196"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14197) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14197)" id="14197"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14198) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14198)" id="14198"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14199) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14199)" id="14199"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (14200) " title="Picture / Image - Image (14200)" id="14200"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),1713);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p><strong> TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra</strong></p>',2249);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p><strong>TinySA是一种小型频谱分析仪和信号发生器，具有一些不错的功能：</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>TinySA基本特点:</strong>\n\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 2.8英寸</li>\n		<li>带两个输入端口的频谱分析仪，Low端口用于 10KHz-350MHz 的高质量 MF/HF/VHF 输入，High端口用于 240MHz-960MHz 的 UHF 输入。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器具有两个输出，正弦波输出为100KHz - 350MHz，方波输出为 240MHz-960MHz，信号发生器和频谱分析仪同一时刻只能选择其中的一个功能。</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最多 290个扫描点，提供长达整个低频或高频范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li><strong>TinySA</strong> <strong>Ultra基本特点:</strong>\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 4英寸</li>\n		<li>频谱分析仪模式，初始状态为10KHz-800MHz，在启用独特的Ultra模式的情况下，可以监测高达12GHz的信号。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器模式，正弦波输出在100KHz-800MHz之间，射频测试信号的方波输出高达5.3GHz。</li>\n		<li>200Hz至850KHz的RBW设置提供更高的灵敏度范围。</li>\n		<li>内置 20dB 可选 LNA</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最大 450 个点，提供长达整个频率范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n		<li>MicroSD卡插槽，用于存储测量值，设置和屏幕截图。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>输入步进衰减器从0dB到31dB（不能与LNA结合使用）。</li>\n	<li>内置校准信号发生器，用于自动自检和（低）输入校准。</li>\n	<li>通过USB连接到PC，它成为PC控制的频谱分析仪或信号发生器</li>\n	<li>高达3000mah的可充电电池，可携带至少2小时。</li>\n	<li>最大输入电平 +6dBm。</li>\n	<li>信号发生器功能不能用作跟踪发生器，因为您不能同时使用频谱分析仪和信号发生器功能。</li>\n	<li>由于低成本和非常小的外形尺寸，存在某些相关的微小SA限制和微小SA超限制。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_housing.jpg"></figure>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_ultra.jpg"></figure>\n\n<p><strong>视频教学：</strong></p>\n\n<p>可以在B站也就是哔哩哔哩_bilibili网站搜索TinyRFEquip账号找到介绍TinySA和TinySA Ultra以及其他TinyRFEquip仪器的主要功能介绍视频。例如：</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212">TinySA Ultra对于无线话筒的频率特性检定测量_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</a></p>\n\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212</p>\n\n<p><strong>法律内容</strong></p>\n\n<p>TinySA和TinySA Ultra的名称以及TinySA徽标是我们拥有的注册商标。未经书面许可，不允许其他人使用TinySA这个名字 或 TinySA Ultra 用于任何频谱分析仪产品。</p>','\n',char(10)),2255);
