INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>This NanoVNA-F V3 vna analyzer is a new production machine , with 4.3 inch 800 x 480 large touchscreen display, 1MHz to 6GHz widely measuring range, the scan speed of NanoVNA-F V3 is up to 200 points/s and the maximum scanning points is up to 801.In addition, the nanovna analyzer supports TDR function which is useful for cable lengths measurement.</p>\n\n<p>Compared to the Nanovna-F V2 (50kHz-3GHz), the upgraded Nanovna-F V3 has 1MHz-6GHz ultra-wide measuring frequency range, The S21 dynamic range of NanoVNA-F V3 is 65 dB, while the S11 dynamic range is 50 dB. The scan points is up to 101-801 and the calibration result storage is 12, covering up to the full low or high frequency range. Faster and more accurate measurement performance, you can easily cope with measurement testes in various fields.</p>\n\n<p>This nano vna analyzer measuring tool is made of metal material, which is durable and can effectively shield electromagnetic interference. With SMA connector design which can be used to connect DUTs directly.In addition,it is support PC Software control and compatible with NanoVNA-Saver for convenient measurement data transfer.Built-in 4500m-ah rechargeable battery,with type-C charging cable and LED charging indicator,it can be fully charged within 3 hours,no need to charge frequently.</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=808249048405&amp;pisk=gsf-2cftQoqlq6fJoaymKdxnwGUcJ-bzkg7stHxodiIARgtkxUGWhnTM50T5RHAdvMIpqpZyZ6IAAMhhE_AkdWtAVXvl9wlpRwsUzH4zna7yTBZgjlVGza7HDdoCwYMjGZ8KADwDFViDeHrgj5VgFqOL2lj3ydHKlFL6OU9BVKavSFmWOp9IlrLB-0MINMaYkeYIV4tBOIMX5niBAX9BlSTe5DGBOUaAln8eOHsBFrQjZZwvYYti9Oy2FvZj7W15MsLJeh_YQXGLfemMYa6i9XK87Lt_snhIOsLRJEHfrfeHfO-kIHjbibddleIkmGNsMI9OQwYd27hWZt6VaQf0XDvJg391dKU7NZdJ2dCWeWEWw9sP9LW-8P7XNiWwbLw40EClspKwHmZ5oZKWB9Iu0XtlBZsvIsmmsBSVdMTdc0Iz81fOnKiMXeD7krHELLT2QEjBluCMKDTvjrYoLvJY3EKgkrHELLT2kh4mxvkeH-5..&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0&amp;skuId=5659210298993">Purchase link：NanoVNA V3 1M-6.3GHz network analyzer Antenna filter VSWR impedance RFID measure</a></p>\n\n<p>Price: 1300 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),10509);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>NanoVNA-F V3 is a Portable Vector Network Analyzer (VNA) with frequency range of 1MHz~6GHz. It can be used for S11 and S21 measurements. The S21 dynamic range of NanoVNA-F V3 is 65 dB, while the S11 dynamic range is 50 dB.</p>\n\n<p>NanoVNA-F V3 antenna analyzer is suitable for antenna testing of MF/HF/VHF/UHF/SHF bands. Supports a variety of display formats: Log Mag, Linear Mag, Phase, Smith R+jX, Smith R+L/C, VSWR, Polar, Group delay, Resistance, Reactance, etc. It can also be used to measure filters, amplifiers, attenuators, cables, power dividers, couplers, duplexers and other RF components. For the amateur radio operator or radio enthusiast, this latest vna antenna analyzer will be a very handy analyzer to have.</p>\n\n<p>After optimizing the RF design in our store, the NanoVNA-F V3 uses an independent local oscillator generation chip instead of the harmonic components commonly used in most imitations as a cheap option for local oscillator signals. Additionally, the customized all metal casing and high-quality SMA connector can support customers for longer use and better external shielding performance.</p>\n\n<p>Especially the factory has perfectly calibrated the S21 performance of 3G-6G, far exceeding LiteVNA. It can conveniently monitor power dividers, combiners, filters, attenuators, antennas, cables, amplifiers, mixers, duplexers, couplers, isolators, circulators, adapters, waveguides, differential devices, etc.<br>\nCommon testing functions include: TDR cable connection, standing wave ratio, return loss, insertion loss, flatness, out of band suppression, attenuation, gain, isolation, characteristic impedance, input-output impedance, phase, delay, and 1dB compression point.</p>\n\n<p><b> Features:</b><br>\nFrequency range: 1MHz-6GHz<br>\nS21 dynamic range: 65dB and S11 dynamic range: 50dB<br>\n4.3" high-brightness IPS display with resistive touch panel<br>\nMetal case can effectively shield electromagnetic interference<br>\nSMA connector is stable and durable to use<br>\nFull touch screen and 3 physical buttons enable convenient and smooth operation<br>\nDimensions: 125 x 75 x 20mm/4.9 x 3 x 0.8"<br>\nBuilt-in 4500mAh lithium-ion batteries with endurance time up to 5 hours<br>\nTDR function can be used to measure cable length<br>\nUp to 4 reference traces<br>\nUp to 4 markers, and the marker table can be dragged to anywhere on the screen<br>\n12 save/recall slots<br>\nCharging via USB Type-C, and the charging voltage is 5V DC<br>\nDesigned with a 5V/1A USB power output port<br>\nFirmware upgrade via virtual U disk with USB Type-C cable<br>\nComes with SMA calibration kit and 2 x 20cm/7.9" SMA-JJ RG405 coaxial cable<br>\nSupports console commands and PC software</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (15225) " title="Picture / Image - Image (15225)" id="15225"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Image - 15223 " title="Image - 15223" id="15223"></cms-plugin><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (15227) " title="Picture / Image - Image (15227)" id="15227"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Image - 15222 " title="Image - 15222" id="15222"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p> </p>','\n',char(10)),10515);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p><strong> TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra TinySA Ultra</strong></p>',10526);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p><strong>TinySA是一种小型频谱分析仪和信号发生器，具有一些不错的功能：</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>TinySA基本特点:</strong>\n\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 2.8英寸</li>\n		<li>带两个输入端口的频谱分析仪，Low端口用于 10KHz-350MHz 的高质量 MF/HF/VHF 输入，High端口用于 240MHz-960MHz 的 UHF 输入。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器具有两个输出，正弦波输出为100KHz - 350MHz，方波输出为 240MHz-960MHz，信号发生器和频谱分析仪同一时刻只能选择其中的一个功能。</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最多 290个扫描点，提供长达整个低频或高频范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li><strong>TinySA</strong> <strong>Ultra基本特点:</strong>\n	<ul>\n		<li>屏幕尺寸 4英寸</li>\n		<li>频谱分析仪模式，初始状态为10KHz-800MHz，在启用独特的Ultra模式的情况下，可以监测高达12GHz的信号。</li>\n		<li>信号发生器模式，正弦波输出在100KHz-800MHz之间，射频测试信号的方波输出高达5.3GHz。</li>\n		<li>200Hz至850KHz的RBW设置提供更高的灵敏度范围。</li>\n		<li>内置 20dB 可选 LNA</li>\n		<li>彩色显示屏显示最大 450 个点，提供长达整个频率范围的无间隙覆盖。</li>\n		<li>MicroSD卡插槽，用于存储测量值，设置和屏幕截图。</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li>输入步进衰减器从0dB到31dB（不能与LNA结合使用）。</li>\n	<li>内置校准信号发生器，用于自动自检和（低）输入校准。</li>\n	<li>通过USB连接到PC，它成为PC控制的频谱分析仪或信号发生器</li>\n	<li>高达3000mah的可充电电池，可携带至少2小时。</li>\n	<li>最大输入电平 +6dBm。</li>\n	<li>信号发生器功能不能用作跟踪发生器，因为您不能同时使用频谱分析仪和信号发生器功能。</li>\n	<li>由于低成本和非常小的外形尺寸，存在某些相关的微小SA限制和微小SA超限制。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_housing.jpg"></figure>\n\n<figure><img alt="" src="https://tinysa.org/wiki/uploads/Main/tinySA_ultra.jpg"></figure>\n\n<p><strong>视频教学：</strong></p>\n\n<p>可以在B站也就是哔哩哔哩_bilibili网站搜索TinyRFEquip账号找到介绍TinySA和TinySA Ultra以及其他TinyRFEquip仪器的主要功能介绍视频。例如：</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212">TinySA Ultra对于无线话筒的频率特性检定测量_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</a></p>\n\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yt421u7Y2/?vd_source=8d60a323bdde2d574cb0a85c07cb3212</p>\n\n<p><strong>法律内容</strong></p>\n\n<p>TinySA和TinySA Ultra的名称以及TinySA徽标是我们拥有的注册商标。未经书面许可，不允许其他人使用TinySA这个名字 或 TinySA Ultra 用于任何频谱分析仪产品。</p>','\n',char(10)),10532);
