INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Technological innovation makes future development incredible</strong></p>',18247);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>TinyRFSG-Plus is a signal generator independently developed by our store, which supports a transmission frequency range of 20MHz~6GHz and can transmit a minimum signal of -60dBm; The maximum transmission amplitude reaches+15dBm (frequency range 20MHz~3GHz). And the power accuracy of this signal source is good, basically stable within 2dB.</p>\n\n<p>This signal generator is compact in size and can be carried around. Control the launch settings with the upper computer software, and also support pre configuration of all functions, which can run independently without the upper computer. And it is far superior to similar products on the market in various parameters, and can be used as a calibration source.</p>\n\n<p>TinyRFSG-Plus has added a separate power supply port and two warning lights on the original basis. One is to prompt for power supply, which will light up immediately upon power supply; The other is the RF indicator light, which lights up when the RF is turned on.</p>\n\n<p>It supports three operating modes: mobile, computer, and offline. And more heat dissipation fins have been installed for better heat dissipation performance.</p>\n\n<p><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=851786764090&amp;pisk=gEuIqPMfi9XI8i4RNkAaGo46oe47PC8qe_N-ibQFwyULe_MtwMBL2JQT6SF72a-38uaSBRuULXzLFzGmhvyU4Mo1NjDsFuA3U8eSUbne_E8qtX4uy492uEz-5NNKdMELyQETTWda9ZQHYRauyKJVbaEHlzDKvoZVvGFTI7NRJuHRWGFYB7FL2YeTXSFVpzH-ePhTMW_8ekFRBCN3GWBdy7BOXSVR98H8yCZTZRe8ykH-6b3dR5RQIXO347YvNpKJLJ_RyVNQXhlLBr4Ja5EIuXw6HNg1okwx9R_JpmKs78wikd-ssYmKL5DWldaoI0H8NAB9Ukc-fANILK6uU2cEP5cCgZc_VJitJl1RyfUQCxiSdps3pDk_m5EONEVZ3RhnJcOlBXH4dyFTbEdj6unZ-o0eBwaxmXzE2YxVjyG-vPszNZyfyXj51ob71-R61gjua-X-T6YNC7ELs5Jy1CsqZkFg1-R61gjuv5VZTCO10bf..&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0">Purchase link：TinyRFSG High precision RF signal source 20M-6.3GHz peogrammable 1Hz stepper</a></p>\n\n<p>Price: 2700 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),18259);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>The TinyRFSG-Plus, which is completely independently developed by our store, is the world''s first. Before designing this product, the owner had already purchased various portable signal sources and small desktop signal sources on Taobao. However, they found that these signal sources had inaccurate first power (i.e. without real calibration), second input power amplitude that did not meet the standards stated in the instructions, poor third frequency step accuracy, often ranging from 1KHz to 10KHz, and too many harmonics. The second and third harmonics were basically not suppressed by filters, so square waves were used for counting.</p>\n\n<p>As an engineer, I also need an excellent portable, pocket signal source. My requirement for my own signal source is accurate power: it can easily calibrate other spectrometers; Good harmonic suppression: pure signal; Strong output capability: Try to achieve a maximum output of 15dBm. Of course, as the frequency increases, the output power will decrease, but I will also tell the customer where my limit is; Portable: compact, strong anti-interference ability, suitable for pocket use.</p>\n\n<p>At the same time, as it is our own research and development, we accept customized hardware and upper computer requirements from customers. Specific issues can be discussed in detail. At present, it only supports power supply on the computer side, and the computer software is controlled through the VISA interface.</p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (18266) " title="Picture / Image - Image (18266)" id="18266"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (18267) " title="Picture / Image - Image (18267)" id="18267"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (18268) " title="Picture / Image - Image (18268)" id="18268"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),18265);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>Here are all the documents you need about the device, including user manuals, programming guides, etc. If you have any other questions or interests, please send me a private message and I will answer them for you.</p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="File - TinySA and Ultra_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide_V1.6.pdf " title="File - TinySA and Ultra_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide_V1.6.pdf" id="18288"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="File - NanoVNA-F V2_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide.pdf " title="File - NanoVNA-F V2_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide.pdf" id="18289"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="File - NanoVNA-F V3_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide.pdf " title="File - NanoVNA-F V3_UserManualAndProgrammingGuide.pdf" id="18290"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="File - LiteVNA_User-Guide.pdf " title="File - LiteVNA_User-Guide.pdf" id="18291"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),18287);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #999999;">Technological innovation makes future development incredible</span></p>',18294);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p><strong>What I want to say</strong></p>\n\n<p>The RF field belongs to the communication industry, which is a small part of the so-called information industry. But the wireless radio frequency field is the most important point that distinguishes the communication industry from other electronic industries. From the early mobile phones to the current 5G communication terminals, from the battlefield walkie talkies during World War II to the contemporary global satellite phones, from civilian satellite pots to various high-tech radars for military use, it can be said that everything is changing rapidly.</p>\n\n<p>I entered the communication RF industry after graduation, and over the years, I have gone from being naive to thoughtful, which has been a very difficult journey. The purpose of restoring our store is to collaborate with like-minded friends to research technical issues and promote scientific research together. For friends outside the industry who need knowledge and services in the field of radio frequency, they can come to our store for consultation and negotiation, hoping to help you.</p>\n\n<p>This laboratory is located in A001 studio on the 4th floor of Tianjin Times Digital.</p>\n\n<p style="text-align: center;"><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (18297) " title="Picture / Image - Image (18297)" id="18297"></cms-plugin></p>\n\n<p><strong>Currently, there are products included：LibreVNA Plus, LibreVNA Normal, TinySA, TinySA Ultra ZS406 and ZS407, NanoVNA-F V2, NanoVNA-F V3, LiteVNA, TinyRFSG Smart, TinyRFSG Plus, TinyRFPM</strong></p>','\n',char(10)),18296);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>TinyRFSG: </p>\n\n<p>1.Basic introduction of signal source and display of the whole family bucket: </p>\n\n<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7wull02SPAY">Debut!! high precision and power, ultra portable programmable RF signal generator TinyRFSG</a></p>','\n',char(10)),18310);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<p>The NanoVNA-F_V2 portable vector network analyzer is a new generation product developed on the basis of the NanoVNA-F. It features a 4.3-inch PS LCD display and an aluminum alloy casing, a 5000mAh large capacity lithium battery, and a battery life of up to 7 hours. It supports touch screen and side button operations, and supports both Chinese and English interfaces. This product has undergone deep software optimization based on the previous generation product NanoVNA-F, with a compatible operating interface and a measurement range extended to 4.4GHz. The dynamic range is larger, the measurement is more accurate, and the operation is more convenient.</p>\n\n<p>After optimizing the RF design in our store, NanoVNA-FV2 utilizes ADF4350 and SI5351 to jointly output a maximum transmission frequency of 4.4G. This is different from other low-end products in the NanoVNA series, which use harmonics as the transmission source for more accuracy. Commonly used testing functions for monitoring power dividers, combiners, filters, attenuators, antennas, cables, amplifiers, mixers, duplexers, couplers, isolators, circulators, adapters, waveguides, differential devices, etc. include: TDR cable connection, standing wave ratio, return wave loss, insertion loss, flatness, out of band suppression, attenuation, gain, isolation, characteristic impedance, input-output impedance, phase delay, and 1dB compression point.</p>\n\n<p><br>\nThe hardware features of NanoVNA-F_V2 include but are not limited to the following improvements:<br>\n1. 4.3-inch IPS LCD display screen, resolution 800x480, ultra wide viewing angle, long-term use does not harm the eyes;<br>\n2. All aluminum alloy casing, sturdy and durable, effectively shields electromagnetic interference, ensuring measurement accuracy;<br>\n3. The body size is 125mm * 75mm * 20mm, compact and portable;<br>\n4. The RF interface is SMA, which facilitates the connection of various tested components;<br>\n5. 5000mAh high-capacity lithium battery, with a battery life of up to 7 hours;<br>\n6. Full touch screen design, with 3 side buttons for flexible and convenient operation;<br>\n7. Supports both Chinese and English interfaces;<br>\n8. Optimized UI design, convenient for users to perform measurement operations;<br>\n9. Support screen brightness adjustment;<br>\n10. Firmware can be upgraded through virtual USB flash drive without the need for a programmer, and can be upgraded through the included USB Type-C data cable;<br>\n11. Equipped with high-quality calibration components and RG405 stable phase cables as standard to ensure calibration accuracy;<br>\n12. Designed with a USB power output interface that supports 5V/1A power output;<br>\n13. Using 2A high current charging IC, the charging time is shorter;<br>\n14. Supporting upper computer software, the upper computer supports both Chinese and English interfaces;<br>\n15. The screen image of the device can be obtained by taking screenshots from the upper computer;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Index</strong><br>\nRF output: -9dBm (Max)<br>\nPower consumption: 4500mAh/3.7 battery<br>\nNumber of calibration points: 301<br>\nApply V2 to test the adhesive rod antenna<br>\nRF range: 50kHz~3GHz<br>\nS21 dynamic range: 70dB (1.5GHz), 60dB (3GHz)<br>\nS11 dynamic range: 50dB (1.5GHz), 40dB (3GHz)<br>\nDisplay: 4.3-inch IPSTFT (800 × 480)<br>\nOutput capability: 5V/1A<br>\nUSB interface: USB Type-C<br>\nNumber of scanning points: 301<br>\nNumber of marked points: 4<br>\nCalibration result storage: 5 sets</p>\n\n<p><cms-plugin alt="Image - 18313 " title="Image - 18313" id="18313"></cms-plugin><cms-plugin alt="Picture / Image - Image (18314) " title="Picture / Image - Image (18314)" id="18314"></cms-plugin></p>','\n',char(10)),18312);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES(replace('<ul>\n	<li>The measurement range of  NanoVNA-F V2 is extended to 50k-4.4GHz,the dynamic range is improved, reach to 80db. Can be used to debug the duplexer, more accurate, and simple.Which can measure S-parameter, voltage standing wave ratio SWR, phase map, group delay, Smith chart and so on.</li>\n	<li>Built-in 5000mAh lithium battery, standby time up to 2-3 hours, Using high current 2A charging IC to Shorten charging time, and extended 5V/1A USB output interface. It can be used as a Mobile Power Pack to charge mobile phones when not in use.</li>\n	<li>Support Chinese and English interface;Support interpolation of calibration results.</li>\n	<li>NanoVNA V2 with 4.3-inch IPS LCD display,ultra-wide viewing angle,support screen brightness adjustment,long-term use does not hurt your eyes.Full touching screen design, with 3 side buttons at the same time, flexible and convenient operation.</li>\n	<li>Package List】1 * 4.3inch 3G NanoVNA-F V2 Host;1 * SMA Open Calibration Kit;1 * SMA Short-circuit Calibration Kit;1 * SMA 50Ω Load Calibration Kit;1 * SMA-KK Double-Head Female Hole Adapter;1 * SMA-JJ Double-Head Male Pin Adapter;1 * SMA-JKW Elbow Outer Screw Inner Hole To Inner Screw Inner Needles Adapter;2 * 200mm SMA-JJ RG405 RF Cable;1 * USB Type-C Cable;1 * White Touchscreen Pen</li>\n	<li><a href="https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=807998150178&amp;pisk=gZ-i4X2jyF7szOGdJHssrrHMd30pfGsfTIEAMiCq865QXIIODkPFntaa0l7w-tRvOxM1XK5DiBCBXA1xCSADndb2MspTCeOJUlKt5iEcfisqwbn-2O91ciWO7LZ4CMWf3soA_s5FftHa1-ci2d91cRVqeeo8nkmU7RzVgISF8tWA0PW4bvbFntI4bZra8W5CTiWN0loFLt60u5R40pPFBOVVQOSVYWW1TsSV_skHL66c0slPhJ59gCtEOlsonbfm7XXhS_JNtuvBxOy5901_0QtdQNx4h6rVpHXGS_JwqPvhW9-pxaQLHfSeFedNKgmL7gJHuQYyG4UCjK8wGwAsOyfp8ep2vwy47pxcsa-N--qDIdW2gZYIZuBGXebkjFMbTdRRsUS6H8c9KaYhP97UnPS9yLKfzhogN6Q5nCCpa0rhYZSyQyzyZ0rfLxKUlr_Nd9f-PD6KdeKOFRDnKz85796Z2vD3lr_Nd9f-Kv4rdNWCQ0C..&amp;spm=a21xtw.29978516.0.0&amp;skuId=5490233284178">Purchase link：NanoVNA-F V2 50k-4.4G vector network analyzer Antenna filter impedance matching</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Price: 560 RMB (excluding tax)</p>','\n',char(10)),18364);
INSERT INTO djangocms_text_ckeditor_text VALUES('',18370);
